tomation. Includes Change&lt;br&gt;Tracking" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="201" width="210" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Central patching of Azure VMs and&lt;br&gt;on-prem servers (with Arc)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="201" width="210" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Manages on-prem or multicloud&lt;br&gt;servers, Kubernetes and DBs with&lt;br&gt;the Azure plane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="201" width="210" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Recommendations on cost,&lt;br&gt;reliability, security,&lt;br&gt;performance and operational&lt;br&gt;excellence" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="201" width="210" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="303" width="930" height="81" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="307" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Patch VMs&lt;/b&gt; → Update Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inventory across subscriptions&lt;/b&gt; → Reso